desc:
Grand Central One (2978 Glen Driver, Coquitlam)

2 large bedrooms, EACH with:
- a private bathroom, and
- a private balcony;

Quick access to SkyTrain, 
perfect for working professionals or small families. 

LOCATION:

Living in the heart of the Coquitlam Center Mall close to everything:

5 min walk to Lincoln SkyTrain station;
5 min walk to Coquitlam Center Mall - Walmart, T&T, London Drugs, Sportchek, etc.;
Walking distance to all services - banks, clinics and great restaurants;
Walking distance to Douglas College, Pinetree Secondary, and Gleneagle Secondary;
Walking distance to Coquitlam Public Library, Swimming Center, and Town Center Park;
20 min drive to Simon Fraser University.

FEATURES:

Master bedroom has two clothing closets;
Large private balconies, one for each bedroom;
Storage locker;
Unfurnished;
Underground parking;
Outdoor swimming pool and gym inside the building.

RENTAL TERMS:

$2,700/month;
Internet, electricity and moving fees NOT included
1 year lease required
No smoking and no pets
Need to check credit and reference
Strata fees, property tax and owner's insurance - all covered
Email or text for viewing.

----6288 No. 3 Road Mandarin Residence;
----Right at the Brighouse sky train station of Canada Line;
----On 7th floor, corner unit with air conditioning;


. Minimum 1 year lease, or longer;
. Non smoking is a must, no Airbnb, no sublet.


Please email to arrange a viewing. Include:
1. Applicant names, phone numbers, and emails
2. Description about yourselves (work/school/why you're moving)
